    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d567">

                <pb facs="0555" n="479" xml:id="pg479"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/17355</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Collector Cobb to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegrams]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">El Paso</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-03-06T13:00:00-07:00">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">March 6, 1916, 1 p.m.</hi>
                        </date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Commanding General Gavira in Juarez announced to reporters this morning that
                    Villa was proceeding to border and that he had asked American military
                    authorities to be on lookout for him.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Cobb</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
